<title>JAPAN: MOF likely to auction 10-yr JGB next week -- traders.</title>
<headline>MOF likely to auction 10-yr JGB next week -- traders.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Ministry of Finance (MOF) is likely to auction 10-year Japanese government bonds (JGB) next week, rather than the week after, bond traders said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Earlier, there was market talk the 10-year JGB auction might be held in the week starting May 26. But traders said on Wednesday that the MOF was highly likely to offer the 10-year JGB next week.</p>
<p>-- Tokyo Treasury Desk +81-33432-8570</p>
</text>
